    "detailed_description": "COMING SOON<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs a massive corporation continues to tighten its grip on the lower-classed workforce, societal cracks are beginning to show. Unrest is growing in the lower city as its underpaid citizens struggle to survive day to day. When a horrific plot to forcefully subdue entire districts full of workers is revealed, there seems to be no way out. Can a long-abandoned city provide a path forward?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolve puzzles, meet characters, and explore the city to unravel the story of this dystopian world!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdd this game to your wish list now and get notified when the free demo is released!",
